hadiths[50]{hadithnumber,text}:
"451","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat kartay hue kehtay hain ke ham Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath baithay hue thay ke Ansaari sahabi aaya aur Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko salam kiya aur phir wapas janay laga to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne poocha ke Ae Ansaari bhai! Mera bhai Sa'd kaisa hai? Us ne arz kiya ke acha hai. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke tum mein se kaun un ki iyadat karta hai? Ye keh kar Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) kharay ho gaye aur ham bhi Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath kharay ho gaye aur ham das se zyada aadmi thay, na hamaray paas jootay thay aur na mozay aur na topiyan aur na kurtay, ye kamaal-e-zuhd tha sahaba ka aur duniya se bezaari thi, aur ham us kankareeli zameen mein chalay jatay thay yahan tak ke un tak pahunchay. Aur jo log Sa'd (raziyallahu anhu) ke paas thay wo hat gaye aur Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) aur wo log jo Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath aaye thay un ke paas gaye. (Muslim)"
"452","[AI-translation] Umm Salama (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum beemar ya mayyat ke paas aao to achi baat kaho. Is liye ke farishtay us baat par aameen kehtay hain jo tum kehtay ho. Kehti hain ke jab Abu Salama (raziyallahu anhu) ka inteqal hua to main Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aayi aur arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam)! Abu Salama ka inteqal ho gaya. To Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke yun dua karo ke: Ae Allah! Mujhe aur us ko bakhsh de aur mujhe un se nem-ul-badal ataa farma. Kehti hain ke main ne ye dua ki to Allah Taala ne mujhe un se nem-ul-badal ataa kiya, yani Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam). (Muslim)"
"453","[AI-translation] Abu Sa'id Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Apne beemaron ko, jo marnay ke qareeb hon, La ilaha illallah ki talqeen karo, targheeb dilao. (Muslim)"
"454","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs Allah Taala se milna chahta hai Allah Taala bhi us se milna chahta hai aur jo Allah se milna nahi chahta Allah bhi us se milna nahi chahta. Main ne arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool! Maut ko to ham mein se sab naapasand kartay hain. To Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke mera ye matlab nahi, balke jab momin, ka aakhri waqt hota hai to us, ko Allah ki rehmat aur razamandi aur jannat ki khushkhabri di jati hai to wo Allah se milna chahta hai, aur beemari aur duniya ke makroohaat se jald khalasi pana chahta hai, aur Allah bhi us se milna chahta hai. Aur jab kafir, ka aakhri waqt hota hai to us, ko Allah ke azaab aur us ke ghussa ki khabar di jati hai to wo Allah Taala se milna pasand nahi karta aur Allah bhi us se milna pasand nahi karta. Aik doosri riwayat mein Shuraih bin Hani se riwayat hai ke Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo koi Allah se milna chahta hai Allah bhi us se milna chahta hai aur jo koi Allah Taala se milna naapasand karta hai Allah bhi us se milna naapasand karta hai. Main ye hadees Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se sun kar Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ke paas gaya aur kaha ke Ae Ummul Momineen! Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) ne ham se Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki wo hadees bayan ki ke agar wo hadees theek ho to ham sab tabah ho gaye. Unhon ne kaha ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke farmanay se jo halaak hua wohi haqeeqat mein halaak hua, kaho to wo, hadees, kya hai? Main ne kaha ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke jo Allah Taala se milna chahta hai Allah bhi us se milna chahta hai aur jo Allah se milna nahi chahta Allah bhi us se milna nahi chahta, aur ham mein se to koi aisa nahi hai jo marnay ko bura na samjhay. Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ne kaha ke beshak Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne ye farmaya hai lekin us ka matlab ye nahi hai jo tu samajhta hai. Balke jab aankhein phir jayein aur dam seenay mein ruk jaye aur royein, yani baal, badan par kharay ho jayein aur ungliyan tashannuj zada ho jayein, yani naza ki haalat mein, to, us waqt jo Allah se milna pasand karay Allah bhi us se milna pasand karta hai aur jo Allah se milna naapasand karay Allah bhi us se milna naapasand karta hai. (Muslim)"
"455","[AI-translation] Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko apni wafaat se aik roz qabal ye farmatay hue suna ke tum mein se koi aadmi na maray magar Allah ke saath naik gumaan rakh kar, yani khatima ke waqt Allah ki rehmat se naaumeed na ho balke apne Maalik ke fazl o karam ki umeed rakhay aur apni nijaat aur maghfirat ka gumaan rakhay. (Muslim)"
"456","[AI-translation] Umm Salama (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Abu Salama (raziyallahu anhu) ki iyadat ko aaye aur us waqt un ki aankhein charh gayi thin, yani faut ho chukay thay, to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un ki aankhein band kar dein aur farmaya: Jab jaan nikalti hai to aankhein us ke peechay lagi rehti hain. Un ke ghar walon mein se logon ne rona shuru kar diya to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke apne liye achi hi dua karo is liye ke farishtay tumhari baaton par aameen kehtay hain. Phir Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne dua ki ke: Ae Allah! Abu Salama (raziyallahu anhu) ko bakhsh de aur un ka darja hidayat walon mein buland kar aur tu un ke baaqi rehnay walay azeezon mein khaleefa ho ja aur un ki qabr un ke liye kushaada aur roshan kar de. Ae tamam jahanon ke paalnay walay! Hamein bhi bakhsh de aur un ko bhi. (Muslim)"
"457","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne wafaat paayi to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) par aik Yamani chaadar daal di gayi. (Muslim)"
"458","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se, Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se bayan kartay hue, kehtay hain ke jab imandaar ki rooh badan se nikalti hai to us ke aagay do farishtay aatay hain aur us ko aasmaan par charha le jatay hain. Hammad, rawi-e-hadees, ne kaha ke Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) ne us rooh ki khushbu ka aur mushk ka zikr bhi kiya aur kaha ke aasmaan walay, farishtay, kehtay hain ke koi paak rooh zameen ki taraf se aayi hai, Allah tujh par rehmat karay aur tere badan par jis ko tu ne aabaad rakha. Phir Rab-ul-Aalameen ke paas us ko le jatay hain. Phir Rab-ul-Aalameen farmata hai ke us ko le jao, apne maqam mein yani illiyeen mein jahan mominon ki arwaah rehti hain, qayamat tak, wahein rakho. Aur kafir ki rooh jab nikalti hai, rawi-e-hadees, Hammad ne kaha ke Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) ne us ki badboo aur us par laanat ka zikr kiya, ke aasmaan walay kehtay hain ke koi napaak rooh zameen ki taraf se aayi hai. Phir hukm hota hai ke us ko le jao, apne maqam sijjeen mein jahan kafiron ki roohein rehti hain, qayamat honay tak. Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne aik baareek kapra jo Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) orhay hue thay, jab kafir ki rooh ka zikr kiya us ki badboo bayan karnay ko, apni naak par daal kar dikhatay hue farmaya ke is tarah se. (Muslim). (Raita se murad baareek kapra hai.)"
"459","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) aik aurat ke paas se guzray jo apne, faut shuda, bachay par ro rahi thi. To Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke Allah se dar aur sabr kar. To wo aurat kehnay lagi ke tumhein meri museebat ka kya andaza hai. Pas jab Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) chalay gaye to aurat se kaha gaya ke beshak wo, kehnay walay, Allah ke Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) thay. To usay maut ke barabar, sadmay, ne aa liya. Chunanche wo aurat Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke darwazay par aayi to us ne Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke darwazay par darbaan na paye. Kehnay lagi Ae Allah ke Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) main ne Aap ko pehchana nahi tha. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke beshak sabr to sadmay ki ibtida ke waqt hota hai. Rawi ko shak hai ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne inda awwali sadmatin ka lafz bola ya inda awwalis sadmati ke alfaaz istemal kiye. (Muslim)"
"460","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Ansaar ki auraton se farmaya ke tum mein se jis ke teen larkay mar jayein aur wo, aurat, Allah ki razamandi ke wastay sabr karay, to jannat mein jaye gi. Aik aurat boli ke Ae Allah ke Rasool! Agar do bachay marein to? Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke do hi sahi. Aik doosri sanad se marfooan riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke jis Musalman ke teen bachay mar jayein us ko jahannam ki aag na lagay gi magar qasam utarnay ke liye, yani Allah Taala ne farmaya ke: Tum mein se koi aisa nahi hai jo dozakh par se na guzray. Us wajah se us ka guzar bhi dozakh par se ho ga lekin aur kisi tarah azaab na ho ga. (Muslim)"
"461","[AI-translation] Umm Salama (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko ye farmatay hue suna ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) farmatay thay ke jab kisi banday ko takleef pahunchay aur wo ye dua padhay: Inna lillahi wa inna ilaihi rajioon, Allahumma ajurni fi museebati wakhluf li khairam minha. Yani yaqeenan ham bhi Allah Taala ke liye hain aur yaqeenan ham, bhi, usi ki taraf lautnay walay hain. Ae Allah mujhe meri is museebat mein ajar de aur us ke baad mujhe, zaya shuda cheez se, behtar cheez ataa farma. Is dua ke padhtay rehnay se Allah Taala us ko us museebat ka sawab deta hai aur, zaya shuda cheez se, behtar cheez bhi ataa farmata hai. Umm Salama (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha ke jab, mera pehla khawand, Abu Salama (raziyallahu anhu) faut ho gaya to main ne, mazkoora dua, padhi jaisa ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mujhe hukm diya tha, to, us dua ki barkat se, Allah Taala ne mujhe, pehlay khawand, se achay khawand, yani Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam), ataa farma diye. (Muslim)"
"462","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Sa'd bin Ubada (raziyallahu anhu) beemar hue to Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) un ki iyadat ko aaye aur Abdur Rahman bin Auf, Sa'd aur Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) un ke saath thay. Jab Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) un ke paas aaye to unhein behosh paya, to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne poocha ke kya inteqal ho gaya hai? Logon ne arz kiya ke nahi. Phir Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ronay lagay. Logon ne jab Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko rotay dekha to sab ronay lagay. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke suntay ho, Allah Taala aankhon ke aansuon par aur dil ke gham par azaab nahi karta, wo to us, Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne zubaan ki taraf ishara kiya, ki bina par azaab karta hai ya rehmat karta hai. Yani jab kalima-e-khair munh se nikalay to reham karta hai aur jab kalima-e-sharr nikalay to azaab karta hai. (Muslim)"
"463","[AI-translation] Abu Malik Ashari (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Meri ummat mein jahiliyat, yani zamana-e-kufr, ki chaar cheezein hain ke log un ko na chhorein ge. Aik apne hasab par fakhr karna. Doosra aik doosray ke nasab par taan karna. Teesray taaron se barish ki umeed rakhna aur chauthay ye ke bain kar ke rona. Aur bain karnay wali agar apne marnay se pehle tauba na karay to qayamat ke din us par gandhak aur kharish, laganay, wali qamees ho gi. (Muslim)"
"464","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Wo shakhs ham mein se nahi, jo gaalon ko peetay aur girebanon ko phaaray ya jahiliyat, kufr, ke zamanay ki baatein karay. Aik aur riwayat mein, au, ki jagah, wa, ka lafz hai. (Muslim)"
"465","[AI-translation] Amra bint Abdur Rahman (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se suna, aur un ke saamnay us baat ka zikr hua ke Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke murday par zinda ke ronay se azaab hota hai to, Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ne kaha ke Allah Abu Abdur Rahman (raziyallahu anhu) ko bakhshay, unhon ne jhoot nahi kaha magar bhool ho gayi. Haqeeqat ye hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) aik Yahudi aurat par guzray ke log us par ro rahay thay, to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke ye to us par rotay hain aur us ko qabr mein azaab ho raha hai. (Muslim)"
"466","[AI-translation] Abu Qatada bin Ribi (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas se aik janaza guzra to Aap ne farmaya: Khud aaraam panay wala hai aur us ke janay se aur logon ne aaraam paya. Logon ne arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool! Ye khud aaraam panay wala hai aur logon ko us se aaraam ho ga, ka matlab kya hai? Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke momin duniya ki takleefon se aaraam pata hai, yani maut ke waqt, aur bad aadmi ke janay se banday, sheher, darakht aur janwar aaraam patay hain. (Muslim)"
"467","[AI-translation] Umm Atiyya (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat karti hain ke jab Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki sahabzadi Zainab (raziyallahu anha) ka inteqal hua to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne ham se farmaya ke us ko taq martaba teen ya paanch martaba ghusl do. Aur paanchwin baar kafoor ya, farmaya ke, thora sa kafoor daal do. (Muslim)"
"468","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko sahool ki bani hui teen safed roi ki bani hui chaadron mein kafan diya gaya. Un mein na kurta tha, na amama aur hulla ka logon ko shubha ho gaya hai. Haqeeqat ye hai ke hulla Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke liye khareeda gaya tha ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko us mein kafan diya jaye, phir na diya gaya aur teen chaadron mein diya gaya jo safed sahool ki bani hui thin. Aur hulla ko Abdullah bin Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) ne liya aur kaha ke main usay rakh chhorun ga aur main apna kafan usi se karun ga. Phir kaha ke agar Allah ko ye pasand hota to us ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke kafan ke kaam aata so us ko baich daala aur us ki qeemat khairaat kar di. (Muslim)"
"469","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne aik din khutba irshad farmaya aur apne ashaab mein se aik shakhs ka zikr kiya jin ka inteqal ho chuka tha aur un ko aisa kafan diya gaya tha jis se satr nahi dhaanpa jata tha aur shab ko dafan kar diya gaya tha. Pas Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne unhein raat mein dafan karnay par narazgi ka izhaar kiya ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un ki namaz-e-janaza na padhi. Magar jab insaan lachaar ho jaye. Aur Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke jab tum mein se koi apne bhai ko kafan de to acha kafan de, taake us ke tamam badan ko khoob achi tarah dhaanp lenay wala ho. (Muslim)"
"470","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Janaza le janay mein jaldi karo. Is liye ke agar naik hai to usay khair ki taraf le jatay ho aur agar bad hai to usay apni gardan se utartay ho. (Muslim)"
"471","[AI-translation] Umm Atiyya (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hamein janaza ke saath chalnay se roka jata tha magar taakeed se nahi. (Muslim)"
"472","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Aik janaza guzra to Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) kharay ho gaye to ham bhi Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath kharay ho gaye. Phir ham ne arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool! Wo to Yahudi aurat ka janaza hai. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke maut ghabrahat ki cheez hai, jab tum janaza dekho to kharay ho jao. (Muslim)"
"473","[AI-translation] Ali (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko kharay hotay hue dekha to ham bhi Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath kharay hue aur wo baithnay lagay phir ham bhi baithnay lagay, yani janaza mein. (Muslim)"
"474","[AI-translation] Samura bin Jundab (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke peechay Ka'b (raziyallahu anhu) ki maan par namaz-e-janaza padhi jo nifaas mein faut ho gayi thin aur Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) un ke janaza ke wast mein kharay hue. (Muslim)"
"475","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Najashi ki maut ki khabar di, jis din ke un ka inteqal hua. Aur sahaba ke saath Eidgah mein gaye aur un ki, namaz-e-janaza par, chaar takbeerein padhein. (Muslim)"
"476","[AI-translation] Abdur Rahman bin Abu Laila se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Zaid (raziyallahu anhu) hamaray janazon ki namaz mein chaar takbeerein kaha kartay thay aur aik janaza par paanch takbeerein kahein to main ne poocha to unhon ne kaha ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) bhi kabhi kabhi paanch takbeerein kaha kartay thay. (Muslim)"
"477","[AI-translation] Auf bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne aik janaza par namaz padhi aur main ne Aap ki dua mein se ye alfaaz yaad rakhay: Ae Allah! Us ko bakhsh de, us par reham kar, us ko aafiyat mein rakh, us ko maaf kar, apni inayat se meharbani kar, us ka ghar, qabr, kushaada kar de, us ko pani, baraf aur aulon se dho de, us ko gunaahon se saaf kar de jaisay safed kapra mail se saaf ho jata hai, us ko ghar ke badlay us se behtar ghar de, us ke logon se behtar log de, us ki biwi se behtar biwi de, jannat mein le ja aur azaab-e-qabr se bacha. Yahan tak ke main ne aarzu ki ke ye marnay wala main hota. (Muslim)"
"478","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat hai ke jab, Fateh-e-Iran, Sa'd bin Abu Waqqas (raziyallahu anhu) ne inteqal farmaya to Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki azwaaj-e-mutahharat ne kehla bheja ke un ka janaza masjid mein se le aao ke ham bhi namaz padh lein, so aisa hi kiya gaya. Aur un ke hujron ke aagay janaza rakh diya ke wo namaz padh lein aur janaza ko Baab-ul-Janaiz se jo Maqaid ki taraf tha, wahan se bahar le gaye. Logon ko ye khabar pahunchi to aib karnay lagay aur kaha ke janaza kahin masjid mein laatay hain? Us par Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ne kaha ke log kya jaldi aib karnay lagay us cheez ke mutaliq jis ka un ko ilm nahi hai. Unhon ne ham par aib kiya ke janaza ko masjid mein laaye halanke baat ye hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Baiza ke betay Sohail ki namaz-e-janaza masjid ke andar hi padhi thi. (Muslim)"
"479","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke aik Habshi aurat masjid ki khidmat karti thi ya aik jawan tha aur us ke baaray mein Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne poocha to logon ne arz kiya ke wo mar gayi. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke tum ne mujhe khabar na ki. Kaha goya ke unhon ne us ko haqeer jaan kar Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko takleef dena munasib na jana. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke mujhe us ki qabr batao. Logon ne batayi to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us par namaz padhi aur farmaya: Ye qabrein andheray se bhari hui hain aur Allah Taala meri namaz ki wajah se un ko roshan kar deta hai. (Muslim)"
"480","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Samura (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aik shakhs, ka janaza, laya gaya, jis ne apne aap ko aik chauray teer se maar daala tha. To Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us ki namaz-e-janaza na padhi. (Muslim)"
"481","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs janaza par haazir rahay yahan tak ke namaz padhi jaye, aur us mein shareek ho to, us ko aik qeeraat ka sawab hai aur jo shakhs, namaz-e-janaza ke baad, dafan tak haazir rahay to us ko do qeeraat ka sawab hai. Sahaba ne poocha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool! Do qeeraat ka kya matlab hai? To Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke do baray paharon ke barabar sawab. (Muslim)"
"482","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat karti hain ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Koi murda aisa nahi ke us par Musalmanon ka aik giroh, jis ki ginti sau tak pahunchti ho, namaz-e-janaza padhay aur phir sab us ki shafaat karein, yani Allah se us ki maghfirat ki dua karein, magar ye ke un ki shafaat qabool ho gi. (Muslim)"
"483","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke un ka aik farzand, maqam, Qudaid ya Usfan mein faut ho gaya to unhon ne, apne ghulam se, kaha ke Ae Kuraib! Dekho kitnay log, namaz-e-janaza ke liye, jama hain? Kuraib ne kaha ke main gaya aur dekha ke log jama hain to unhein khabar ki to Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) ne kaha ke tumharay andazay mein chaalees hain? Main ne kaha ke haan. Kaha ke janaza nikalo, is liye ke main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se suna hai ke jis Musalman ke janazay mein chaalees aadmi aisay hon, jinhon ne Allah ke saath kisi cheez ko shareek na kiya ho to Allah Taala us ke haq mein un ki shafaat zaroor qabool karta hai. (Muslim)"
"484","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Aik janaza guzra aur logon ne usay acha kaha to Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke wajib ho gayi, teen baar, yehi, farmaya. Phir doosra janaza guzra to logon ne usay bura kaha. Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke wajib ho gayi, teen baar, yehi, farmaya. Umar (raziyallahu anhu) ne arz kiya ke mere maan baap Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) par fida hon, aik janaza guzra aur logon ne usay acha kaha Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne teen baar farmaya ke wajib ho gayi. Phir doosra guzra to logon ne usay bura kaha, Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne teen baar farmaya ke wajib ho gayi. Us ka kya matlab hai, kya cheez wajib ho gayi? Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke jis ko tum ne acha kaha us ke liye jannat wajib ho gayi aur jis ko bura kaha us par dozakh wajib ho gayi. Tum zameen mein Allah ke gawah ho, tum zameen mein Allah ke gawah ho, tum zameen mein Allah ke gawah ho. (Muslim)"
"485","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Samura (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Ibn Dahdah ki namaz-e-janaza padhi. Phir Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aik nangi peeth wala ghora, baghair zeen ke, laya gaya. Us ko aik shakhs ne pakra phir Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) sawaar hue aur wo koodta tha aur ham sab Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke peechay thay aur daurtay thay. So qaum mein se aik shakhs ne kaha ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke Ibn Dahdah ke liye jannat mein kitnay khoshay latak rahay hain. (Muslim)"
"486","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki qabr-e-mubarak mein surkh chaadar daali gayi thi. (Muslim)"
"487","[AI-translation] Amir bin Sa'd se riwayat hai ke, Fateh-e-Iran, Sa'd bin Abu Waqqas (raziyallahu anhu) ne apni us beemari mein, jis mein un ka inteqal hua ye farmaya ke mere liye lahad banana aur us par kachi eentein lagana jaisay Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke liye banayi gayi. (Muslim)"
"488","[AI-translation] Abul Hayyaj Asadi kehtay hain ke mujh se Ali (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke main tumhein us kaam ke liye bhejta hun jis kaam ke liye mujhe Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne bheja tha ke har tasveer ko mita do aur har oonchi qabr ko, zameen ke, barabar kar do. (Muslim)"
"489","[AI-translation] Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne qabr ko pukhta karnay, us par baithnay, majawari karnay, aur us par imarat, gumbad waghera, bananay se mana farmaya hai. (Muslim)"
"490","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se jab koi mar jata hai to subah o shaam us ke saamnay us ka thikana pesh kiya jata hai. Agar jannat walon mein se hai to jannat walon mein se aur jo dozakh walon mein se hai to dozakh walon mein se. Phir kaha jata hai ke ye tera thikana hai, yahan tak ke Allah Taala tujhe qayamat ke din us, thikanay ki, taraf bhejay ga. (Muslim)"
"491","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab banda apni qabr mein rakha jata hai aur us ke saathi peeth mor kar laut-tay hain to wo un ke jooton ki aawaz sunta hai. Phir do farishtay us ke paas aatay hain aur us se kehtay hain ke tu us shakhs ke baaray mein kya kehta tha, yani Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke baaray mein Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka naam tazeem se nahi letay taake wo samajh na jaye. Momin kehta hai ke main gawahi deta hun ke wo Allah ke banday aur us ke Rasool hain. Un par Allah Taala ki rehmat aur salamti ho. Phir us se kaha jata hai ke tu apna thikana jahannam mein se dekh le us, thikanay, ke badlay Allah Taala ne tujhe jannat mein thikana diya. Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke wo apne donon thikanay dekhta hai. Qatada ne kaha ke Anas (raziyallahu anhu) ne ham se zikr kiya ke us ki qabr sattar haath chauri kar di jati hai aur sabza se bhar jati hai, yani bagheecha ban jata hai, qayamat tak, yunhi rahay ga. (Muslim)"
"492","[AI-translation] Bara bin Azib (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ye aayat: Allah Taala iman walon ko pakki baat par qaim rakhta hai, qabr ke azaab ke baaray mein utri hai. Mayyat se poocha jata hai, tera Rab kaun hai? Wo kehta hai ke mera Rab Allah Taala hai aur mere Nabi Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) hain. Allah Taala ke is qaul: Allah Taala iman walon ko duniya aur aakhirat mein pakki baat par qaim rakhta hai, se yehi murad hai. (Muslim)"
"493","[AI-translation] Bara bin Azib (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Bani Najjar ke baagh mein apne aik khachar par ja rahay thay aur ham Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath thay. Itnay mein wo khachar badka aur qareeb tha ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko gira de. Wahan par chhe ya paanch ya chaar qabrein thin. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne poocha ke koi janta hai ke ye qabrein kin ki hain? Aik shakhs bola ke main janta hun. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke ye log kab maray? Wo shakhs bola ke shirk ke zamanay mein. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke is ummat ka imtihan qabron mein hota hai. Phir agar tum, apne murdon ko, dafan karna na chhor do to main Allah Taala se dua karta ke tum ko qabr ka azaab suna deta, jo main sun raha hun. Us ke baad Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) hamari taraf mutawajjah hue aur farmaya ke jahannam ke azaab se Allah Taala ki panah maango. Logon ne kaha ke ham jahannam ke azaab se Allah ki panah maangtay hain. Phir Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke qabr ke azaab se Allah ki panah maango. Logon ne kaha ke ham qabr ke azaab se Allah ki panah maangtay hain. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke chhupay aur khulay fitnon se Allah ki panah maango. Logon ne kaha ke ham chhupay aur khulay fitnon se Allah ki panah maangtay hain. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke Dajjal ke fitna se Allah ki panah maango. Logon ne kaha ke ham Dajjal ke fitna se Allah ki panah maangtay hain. (Muslim: 8/160-161). Baab: Yahud ko us ki qabr mein azaab. (Ishraak se murad kufar ka zamana hai; tadafun se murad dafan karna hai.)"
"494","[AI-translation] Abu Ayyub (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne aaftab ke doobnay ke baad aik aawaz suni to farmaya ke Yahudiyon ko un ki qabron mein azaab ho raha hai. (Muslim: 8/161). Baab: Qabron ki ziyarat aur un ke liye istighfar."
"495","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne apni walida ki qabr ki ziyarat ki to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ro paray. Aur Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne apne irdgird logon ko bhi rula diya. To Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke main ne apne Rab se apni walida ke liye istighfar karnay ki ijazat maangi to mujhe ijazat nahi di gayi. Aur main ne qabr ki ziyarat ki ijazat talab ki to mujhe ijazat de di gayi. Lihaza tum qabron ki ziyarat kiya karo, ye maut yaad dilati hain. (Muslim: 3/65)"
"496","[AI-translation] Buraida (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Main tumhein qabron ki ziyarat karnay se mana karta tha, pas ab tum ziyarat kiya karo. Aur main tumhein teen din se zyada qurbani ka gosht rakhnay se mana karta tha, pas ab jab tak chaho rakho. Aur main tumhein mashkon ke siwa aur bartanon mein nabeez, peenay, se mana karta tha, pas ab peenay ke bartanon mein se jis mein chaho piyo magar nasha ki cheez na piyo. (Muslim)"
"497","[AI-translation] Muhammad bin Qais ne aik din kaha ke kya main tumhein apni baat aur apni maan ki baat na sunaun? Ham ne ye khayal kiya ke shayad maan se wo murad hain jinhon ne un ko jana hai. Phir unhon ne kaha Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ne kaha ke main tum ko apni aur Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki baat sunaun? Ham ne kaha ke zaroor. Unhon ne kaha ke aik raat Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) mere paas thay ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne karwat li aur apni chaadar rakhi aur joota nikaal kar apne paon ke aagay rakha aur chaadar ka kinara apne bichhonay par bichhaya aur lait gaye. Thori dair us khayal se thehray rahay ke gumaan kar liya ke main so gayi hun. Phir aahista se apni chaadar li aur aahista se joota pehna aur aahista se darwaza khola, niklay aur phir aahista se us ko band kar diya. Main ne bhi apni chaadar li aur sar par orhi aur ghonghat, aur Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke peechay chal pari yahan tak ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Baqi pahunche aur dair tak kharay rahay. Phir donon haath teen baar uthaye aur phir lautay to main bhi lauti. Aur Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) jaldi chalay to main bhi jaldi chali aur Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) dauray aur main bhi dauri aur Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ghar aa gaye aur main bhi aa gayi magar Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se aagay aayi aur ghar mein aatay hi lait gayi. Jab Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ghar mein aaye to farmaya ke Ae Aisha! Tumhein kya hua ke tumhara saans phool raha hai aur pait phoola hua hai? Main ne kaha ke kuch nahi. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke bata do nahi to wo baareek been khabardaar, yani Allah Taala, mujhe khabar kar de ga. Main ne arz kiya ke mere maan baap Aap par fida hon. Phir main ne Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko khabar di, yani saari baat bata di, to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke aik saya sa jo mere aagay nazar aata tha, wo tum hi thin? Main ne kaha ji haan, to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mere seenay par ghonsa maara, ye mohabbat se tha, ke mujhe dard hua aur farmaya ke tu ne khayal kiya ke Allah aur us ka Rasool tera haq daba le ga? Yani tumhari baari mein main aur kisi biwi ke paas chala jaun ga. Tab main ne kaha ke jab log koi cheez chhupatay hain to Allah Taala us ko janta hai, yani agar Aap kisi aur biwi ke paas jatay to bhi Allah Taala dekhta tha. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke mere paas Jibrail (alaihissalam) aaye jab tu ne, mujhe uthtay hue, dekha. Unhon ne mujhe pukara aur tum se chhupaya, to main ne bhi chaha ke tum se chhupaun. Aur wo tumharay paas nahi aaye thay ke tum ne, sonay ki gharz se, apna zaaid kapra utaar diya tha aur main samjha ke tum so gayein, so main ne bura jana ke tumhein jagaun aur ye bhi khauf kiya ke tum ghabra jao gi ke kahan chalay gaye. Phir Jibrail (alaihissalam) ne kaha ke tumhara parwardigaar hukm farmata hai ke tum Baqi ko jao aur ahl-e-Baqi ke liye maghfirat maango. Main ne arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool! Main kaisay kahun? Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke kaho: Ahl-e-Islam aur imandaar ghar walon par salam hai aur Allah Taala rehmat karay ham se aagay janay walon par aur peechay janay walon par aur Allah ne chaha to ham bhi, faut ho kar, tum se milnay walay hain. (Muslim)"
"498","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke agar koi aik angaray par baithay jo us ke kapron ko jala de aur us ki khaal tak, us ka asar, pahunchay, to bhi qabr par baithnay, yani majawari karnay, se behtar hai. (Muslim)"
"499","[AI-translation] Abu Marsad Ghanawi (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Na qabr par baitho aur na us ki taraf namaz padho. (Muslim)"
"500","[AI-translation] Abu Zarr (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se poocha gaya ke Aap is shakhs ke baaray mein kya farmatay hain jo achay aamaal karta hai aur log us ki tareef kartay hain? Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke ye bilfail khushkhabri hai momin ko, yani aakhirat mein jo sawab aur ajar hai wo to alag hai ye us ke liye duniya hi mein khushi hai ke log us ki tareef kartay hain. (Muslim)"
